# Eclipsed Kithkin: "When this creature enters, look at the top four cards of your library. You may reveal a Kithkin, Forest, or Plains card from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order." (CR 701.20a, 401.4) The top four are Figure of Fable, Forest, Plains and Mountain; the fifth, a Mountain, is not looked at.
